ople_name":"瑛","people_name_jianti_auto":"瑛","start_index":384,"tongjian_id":"bcd7eb3f-db0e-11ef-bdad-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"肅宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"肃宗","start_index":392,"tongjian_id":"bcd7eb40-db0e-11ef-a165-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李林甫","people_name_jianti_auto":"李林甫","start_index":402,"tongjian_id":"bcd7eb41-db0e-11ef-aafe-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韋堅","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦坚","start_index":407,"tongjian_id":"bcd7eb42-db0e-11ef-a0f6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"汝州","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝州","place_note":"河南汝州","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"bcd7eb43-db0e-11ef-9754-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":443,"tongjian_id":"bcd7eb44-db0e-11ef-8a93-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"廣成苑","place_name_jianti_auto":"广成苑","start_index":444,"tongjian_id":"bcd7eb45-db0e-11ef-943d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":448,"tongjian_id":"bcd7eb46-db0e-11ef-a417-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汝州","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝州","start_index":449,"tongjian_id":"bcd7eb47-db0e-11ef-a0f9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"梁縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"梁县","start_index":451,"tongjian_id":"bcd7eb48-db0e-11ef-a6a2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：令狐峘代宗實錄云：「上以開元十四年十月十三日生，時玄宗幸汝州之溫湯，有望氣者云，宮中有天子氣，玄宗卽日還宮，是夜代宗降誕。」按玄宗實錄，此月十六日庚申始幸溫湯，己巳乃還宮，與代宗實錄不同。舊紀云「十二月十三日生」。舊·后妃傳：「章敬皇后吳氏坐父事沒入掖庭，開元二十三年，玄宗幸忠王邸，見王服御蕭然，傍無媵侍，命將軍高力士選掖庭宮人以賜之，而吳后在籍中；明年，生代宗皇帝，十八年薨。」按代宗此年生，而云二十三年以吳后賜忠王，十八年薨，蓋誤以十三年爲二十三年也。次柳氏舊聞：「肅宗在東宮爲李林甫所構，勢幾危者數矣，無何，須鬢斑白。嘗早朝，上見之，愀然曰：『汝歸第，吾當幸汝。』及上至，顧見宮庭殿宇皆不洒掃，而樂器塵埃，左右使令無有妓女。上爲之動色，使力士詔掖庭按籍閱視得三人，乃以賜以太子，而章敬吳皇后在選中，生代宗。」按開元二十三年，李林甫初爲相，二十五年廢太子瑛，二十六年乃立肅宗爲太子，天寶五年李林甫始構韋堅之獄。舊聞所記，事皆虛誕，年月不合。新書·后妃傳全取之，今皆不取。按漢廣成苑在唐汝州梁縣界，其地有湯泉。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：令狐峘代宗实录云：「上以开元十四年十月十三日生，时玄宗幸汝州之温汤，有望气者云，宫中有天子气，玄宗即日还宫，是夜代宗降诞。」按玄宗实录，此月十六日庚申始幸温汤，己巳乃还宫，与代宗实录不同。旧纪云「十二月十三日生」。旧·后妃传：「章敬皇后吴氏坐父事没入掖庭，开元二十三年，玄宗幸忠王邸，见王服御萧然，傍无媵侍，命将军高力士选掖庭宫人以赐之，而吴后在籍中；明年，生代宗皇帝，十八年薨。」按代宗此年生，而云二十三年以吴后赐忠王，十八年薨，盖误以十三年为二十三年也。次柳氏旧闻：「肃宗在东宫为李林甫所构，势几危者数矣，无何，须鬓斑白。尝早朝，上见之，愀然曰：『汝归第，吾当幸汝。』及上至，顾见宫庭殿宇皆不洒扫，而乐器尘埃，左右使令无有妓女。上为之动色，使力士诏掖庭按籍阅视得三人，乃以赐以太子，而章敬吴皇后在选中，生代宗。」按开元二十三年，李林甫初为相，二十五年废太子瑛，二十六年乃立肃宗为太子，天宝五年李林甫始构韦坚之狱。旧闻所记，事皆虚诞，年月不合。新书·后妃传全取之，今皆不取。按汉广成苑在唐汝州梁县界，其地有汤泉。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"bcd7eb2a-db0e-11ef-ab8e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"嚴","people_name_jianti_auto":"严","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"bcd7eb54-db0e-11ef-b7d0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『嚴：「酉」改「「巳」。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『严：「酉」改「「巳」。』","note_type":"『嚴：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bcd7eb53-db0e-11ef-9606-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"bcd7eb52-db0e-11ef-a88e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"汝州","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝州","place_note":"河南汝州","resolved_place_entity_id":801,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"bcd7eb55-db0e-11ef-ac9a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"14冬，十月，庚申，上幸汝州廣成湯；己酉，還宮。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十月十六日庚申，唐玄宗驾临汝州广成温泉；己酉日，返回皇宫。","content_jianti_auto":"14冬，十月，庚申，上幸汝州广成汤；己酉，还宫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21402,"number":14,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百一十三 (唐紀二十九) / 玄宗至道大聖大明孝皇帝中之上 / 開元十四年 / 第 17 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"bcd7eb29-db0e-11ef-aa1f-a0d3651f611f","year_int":726},"tongjian_id":"bcd7eb29-db0e-11ef-aa1f-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":6},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"汝州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"石堡城","place_name_jianti_auto":"石堡城","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"bce5ed3a-db0e-11ef-90ee-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"以平石堡城之功也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"以平石堡城之功也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"bce5ed39-db0e-11ef-aa65-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"李宙","people_name_jianti_auto":"李宙","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"bce5ed3e-db0e-11ef-986e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"禕","people_name_jianti_auto":"祎","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"bce5ed3f-db0e-11ef-9bd7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"禕","people_name_jianti_auto":"祎","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"bce5ed40-db0e-11ef-8ee7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"融","people_name_jianti_auto":"融","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"bce5ed41-db0e-11ef-ae55-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李宙","people_name_jianti_auto":"李宙","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"bce5ed42-db0e-11ef-a919-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：舊傳曰：「殿中侍御史李宙驛召禕將下獄，禕旣申訴得理，融坐阿黨李宙貶。」今從唐曆。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：旧传曰：「殿中侍御史李宙驿召祎将下狱，祎既申诉得理，融坐阿党李宙贬。」今从唐历。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"bce5ed3d-db0e-11ef-9677-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"六月甲戌，至九月壬子，九十九日耳。","note_content_jianti_auto":"六月甲戌，至九月壬子，九十九日耳。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":77,"tongjian_id":"bce5ed46-db0e-11ef-b11c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"bce5ed38-db0e-11ef-b7d8-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"yī","source_anchor_text":"矣信安王禕以軍功有","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":3,"text":"禕","tongjian_id":"55c175eb-44ca-5d3a-b6ce-693b0da358bc"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"汝州","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝州","place_note":"河南汝州","resolved_place_entity_id":801,"start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"bce5ed50-db0e-11ef-8d88-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"信安王禕，以軍功有寵於上，融疾之。禕入朝，融使御史李寅彈之，泄於所親。禕聞之，先以白上。明日，寅奏果入，上怒，九月，壬子，融坐貶汝州刺史，凡爲相百日而罷。是後言財利以取貴仕者，皆祖於融。","content_fanyi":"信安王李祎，因军功而受玄宗宠信，宇文融嫉妒他。李祎进京朝见，宇文融指使御史李寅弹劾他，却把这件事泄露给了自己亲近的人。李祎得知后，抢先将情况禀报玄宗。第二天，李寅的奏章果然呈入，玄宗大怒，九月二十五日壬子，宇文融获罪被贬为汝州刺史，担任宰相前后总共不过一百天便遭罢免。此后，凡是靠谈论搜刮财利来谋取显贵官职的人，都以宇文融为祖师。","content_jianti_auto":"信安王祎，以军功有宠于上，融疾之。祎入朝，融使御史李寅弹之，泄于所亲。祎闻之，先以白上。明日，寅奏果入，上怒，九月，壬子，融坐贬汝州刺史，凡为相百日而罢。是后言财利以取贵仕者，皆祖于融。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21458,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百一十三 (唐紀二十九) / 玄宗至道大聖大明孝皇帝中之上 / 十七年 / 第 13 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"bce5ed38-db0e-11ef-b7d8-a0d3651f611f","year_int":729},"tongjian_id":"bce5ed38-db0e-11ef-b7d8-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":7},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"汝州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"戲水","place_name_jianti_auto":"戏水","place_note":"渭水支流，流经陕西临潼东","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd84751a-db0e-11ef-a748-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"新豐","place_name_jianti_auto":"新丰","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"bd84751b-db0e-11ef-a195-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"戲水在新豐東。戲，許宜翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"戏水在新丰东。戏，许宜翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"bd847519-db0e-11ef-8316-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"會昌","place_name_jianti_auto":"会昌","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"bd84751e-db0e-11ef-9f29-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"會昌縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"会昌县","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"bd84751f-db0e-11ef-bc98-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"溫泉宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"温泉宫","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"bd847520-db0e-11ef-a623-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"溫湯卽謂會昌，時置會昌縣於溫泉宮下。首，式救翻，謂自首其事。或曰，首，如字。","note_content_jianti_auto":"温汤即谓会昌，时置会昌县于温泉宫下。首，式救翻，谓自首其事。或曰，首，如字。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":107,"tongjian_id":"bd84751d-db0e-11ef-b551-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"汝州","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝州","place_note":"河南汝州","resolved_place_entity_id":801,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"bd847528-db0e-11ef-83a0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"又使吉溫捕史敬忠於汝州。敬忠與溫父素善，溫之幼也，敬忠常抱撫之。及捕獲，溫不與交言，鎖其頸，以布蒙首，驅之馬前。至戲水，溫使吏誘之曰： 「楊愼矜已款服，惟須子一辯，若解人意則生，不然必死，前至溫湯，則求首不獲矣。」敬忠顧謂溫曰：「七郞，求一紙。」溫陽不應。去溫湯十餘里，敬忠祈請哀切，乃於桑下令答三紙，辯皆如溫意。溫徐謂曰：「丈人且勿怪！」因起拜之。","content_fanyi":"朝廷又派吉温到汝州逮捕史敬忠。史敬忠与吉温的父亲素来交好，吉温年幼时，史敬忠常常抱着抚爱他。待到捕获后，吉温不与他交谈，用枷锁锁住他的脖子，用布蒙住他的头，把他驱赶在马前行走。到了戏水，吉温派吏员诱骗他说：“杨慎矜已经老实服罪，只需要你出面作一次证词；如果你善解人意，就能活命，否则必死无疑，等到了前面的温汤，也就是温泉宫下的会昌，再想自首也办不到了。”史敬忠回头看吉温说：“七郎，请给我一张纸。”吉温假装没有回答。距离温汤十多里时，史敬忠哀求悲切，吉温才令他在桑树下写下三张纸的答辩，答词都符合吉温的心意。吉温这才慢慢对他说：“老伯暂且不要怪罪！”随即起身向他下拜行礼。","content_jianti_auto":"又使吉温捕史敬忠于汝州。敬忠与温父素善，温之幼也，敬忠常抱抚之。及捕获，温不与交言，锁其颈，以布蒙首，驱之马前。至戏水，温使吏诱之曰： 「杨愼矜已款服，惟须子一辩，若解人意则生，不然必死，前至温汤，则求首不获矣。」敬忠顾谓温曰：「七郞，求一纸。」温阳不应。去温汤十余里，敬忠祈请哀切，乃于桑下令答三纸，辩皆如温意。温徐谓曰：「丈人且勿怪！」因起拜之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21788,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百一十五 (唐紀三十一) / 玄宗至道大聖大明孝皇帝中之下 / 六載 / 第 19 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"bd847518-db0e-11ef-a7b1-a0d3651f611f","year_int":747},"tongjian_id":"bd847518-db0e-11ef-a7b1-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":8},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"汝州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"汴","place_name_jianti_auto":"汴","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"bebf6009-db0e-11ef-b6ed-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"滑","place_name_jianti_auto":"滑","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"bebf600a-db0e-11ef-bd69-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"滑州","place_name_jianti_auto":"滑州","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"bebf600b-db0e-11ef-9ccd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"滑","place_name_jianti_auto":"滑","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"bebf600c-db0e-11ef-aae5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"濮","place_name_jianti_auto":"濮","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"bebf600d-db0e-11ef-820c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汴","place_name_jianti_auto":"汴","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"bebf600e-db0e-11ef-b0c4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"曹","place_name_jianti_auto":"曹","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"bebf600f-db0e-11ef-b565-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宋","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"bebf6010-db0e-11ef-9032-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"新書·方鎭表：汴、滑節度使治滑州，領州五：滑、濮、汴、曹、宋。","note_content_jianti_auto":"新书·方镇表：汴、滑节度使治滑州，领州五：滑、濮、汴、曹、宋。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"bebf6008-db0e-11ef-839c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"汝州","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝州","place_note":"河南省汝州市","resolved_place_entity_id":801,"start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"bebf6019-db0e-11ef-a358-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"17壬午，以滑、濮節度使許叔冀爲汴州刺史，充滑、汴等七州節度使；以試汝州刺史劉展爲滑州刺史，充副使。","content_fanyi":"五月十七日壬午，皇上任命滑州、濮州节度使许叔冀为汴州刺史，充任滑州、汴州等七州节度使；又任命试汝州刺史刘展为滑州刺史，充任节度副使。","content_jianti_auto":"17壬午，以滑、濮节度使许叔冀为汴州刺史，充滑、汴等七州节度使；以试汝州刺史刘展为滑州刺史，充副使。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":22289,"number":17,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百二十一 (唐紀三十七) / 肅宗文明武德大聖大宣孝皇帝下之上 / 乾元二年 / 第 23 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"bebf6007-db0e-11ef-9152-a0d3651f611f","year_int":759},"tongjian_id":"bebf6007-db0e-11ef-9152-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":9},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"汝州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"郭","people_name_jianti_auto":"郭","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"bf1afc3c-db0e-11ef-953b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李","people_name_jianti_auto":"李","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"bf1afc3d-db0e-11ef-a59a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"使郭、李爲帥，安有是禍邪！","note_content_jianti_auto":"使郭、李为帅，安有是祸邪！","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"bf1afc3b-db0e-11ef-91e7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"汝州","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝州","resolved_place_entity_id":801,"start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"bf1afc46-db0e-11ef-843f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"回紇入東京，肆行殺略，死者萬計，火累旬不滅。朔方、神策軍亦以東京、鄭、汴、汝州皆爲賊境，所過虜掠，三月乃已。比屋蕩盡，士民皆衣紙。回紇悉置所掠寶貨於河陽，留其將安恪守之。","content_fanyi":"回纥军队进入东京洛阳，肆意屠杀抢掠，死者数以万计，大火几十天不灭。朔方、神策军也把东京、郑州、汴州、汝州都视为叛军控制的地区，所到之处大肆掠夺，历时三个月才停止。成排的房屋荡然无存，士人百姓都穿着纸衣。回纥军队将抢掠来的珍宝货物全部存放在河阳，留下其将领安恪看守。","content_jianti_auto":"回纥入东京，肆行杀略，死者万计，火累旬不灭。朔方、神策军亦以东京、郑、汴、汝州皆为贼境，所过虏掠，三月乃已。比屋荡尽，士民皆衣纸。回纥悉置所掠宝货于河阳，留其将安恪守之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":22478,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百二十二 (唐紀三十八) / 肅宗文明武德大聖大宣孝皇帝下之下 / 寶應元年 / 第 62 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"bf1afc3a-db0e-11ef-a0b0-a0d3651f611f","year_int":762},"tongjian_id":"bf1afc3a-db0e-11ef-a0b0-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":10}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":4,"total_paragraphs":34},"place_name":"汝州"},"message":"success","success":true}